  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved Access to Water and Sanitation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to improve access to water and sanitation for 4000 households in Bulilima, Mangwe and Plumtree.  These areas are currently covered by the LPPZ programme which is running but there are gaps regarding especially establishment of new water sources and coverage of urban and peri-urban households and this project will fill that gap. The project will also include the complementary activities such as sanitation, solid waste management and health and hygiene promotion as a package. Special attention will also be given to institutions such as schools and clinics.</narrative>
  </description>
